OL,3,GNEWSANew food waste plant 'could heat
OL,4,A9,000 homes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal councillor Lianna Konig said she
OL,7,Ffeared whether the benefits outweighed
OL,8,Fthe development's overall impact, and
OL,9,Fexpressed concern about the
OL,10,F"industrialisation" of the countryside.
